  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Heat the olive oil in a frying pan and add the crushed garlic, grated ginger and roughly chopped spring onion. Stir for a minute."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the soy sauce, coconut cream, peanut butter and sesame oil. Mix."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the noodles to the pan with the sauce and toss until coated."
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with fresh coriander and red chilli."
